{"4559240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grid Grief", "steam_appid": 4559240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/a84f0af4f8cd036f4823271377aef386.avif?t=1787587091\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras_big/a84f0af4f8cd036f4823271377aef386.webp?t=1787587091 width=1560 height=349 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/0ce3859c6aaf4b2e5bd88a226dc3d8d3.poster.avif?t=1787587091\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/0ce3859c6aaf4b2e5bd88a226dc3d8d3.webm?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/0ce3859c6aaf4b2e5bd88a226dc3d8d3.mp4?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid Grief</strong> is a roguelite plinko style deckbuilder where you navigate a haunting afterlife by strategically placing soulstones on an ever evolving grid. Every placement is a gamble between progression and permanent loss, forcing you to weigh immediate rewards against long term survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/b1acf9d2c9bbb4cd9c71a49bb74edd0a.poster.avif?t=1787587091\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/b1acf9d2c9bbb4cd9c71a49bb74edd0a.webm?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/b1acf9d2c9bbb4cd9c71a49bb74edd0a.mp4?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/ae5b35fd958b5ad184f197f0ba5f2d38.poster.avif?t=1787587091\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/ae5b35fd958b5ad184f197f0ba5f2d38.webm?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/ae5b35fd958b5ad184f197f0ba5f2d38.mp4?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As your run goes on, you will uncover unique stones, perks and secrets that trigger explosive combos. By collecting and placing stones, you can create game breaking synergies that snowball a standard run into a rule bending escape attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/00b5d559f54a89aa37616f0d19dfa6a0.poster.avif?t=1787587091\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/00b5d559f54a89aa37616f0d19dfa6a0.webm?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/00b5d559f54a89aa37616f0d19dfa6a0.mp4?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/802d94ee4e980680e7b606333b0fa49d.poster.avif?t=1787587091\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/802d94ee4e980680e7b606333b0fa49d.webm?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/802d94ee4e980680e7b606333b0fa49d.mp4?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/6d7766f4206f581043c193041bd4ddde.poster.avif?t=1787587091\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/6d7766f4206f581043c193041bd4ddde.webm?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/6d7766f4206f581043c193041bd4ddde.mp4?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The afterlife doesn’t want you to leave. Fight your way through terrifying bosses, each one pushing your grid to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only hope is to build a grid capable of <strong>shattering a god</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/bf085c2142e8cfcc0d6305739cc82abd.poster.avif?t=1787587091\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/bf085c2142e8cfcc0d6305739cc82abd.webm?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/bf085c2142e8cfcc0d6305739cc82abd.mp4?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Strategy:</strong> A high stakes plinko style deckbuilder where every round could be your last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ unique Effects:</strong> Endless variety in how you influence the outcome of your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamebreaking Synergies:</strong> Discover perks and combinations that allow you to bend the rules and break the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression:</strong> Unlock powerful stones to aid your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plinky Plonking!</strong> Addictive plinky plonking!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/0ce3859c6aaf4b2e5bd88a226dc3d8d3.poster.avif?t=1787587091\" width=800 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/0ce3859c6aaf4b2e5bd88a226dc3d8d3.webm?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559240/extras/0ce3859c6aaf4b2e5bd88a226dc3d8d3.mp4?t=1787587091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grid Grief</strong> is a roguelite plinko style deckbuilder where you navigate a haunting afterlife by strategically placing soulstones on an ever evolving grid. Every placement is a gamble between progression and permanent loss, forcing you to weigh immediate rewards against long term survival.</p><p class=